mapping "M895B.1" source="M895B" target="1332016001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source M895B SNOMED CT 1332016001 203522001 = osteolysis of shoulder/upper arm region incl.
        clavicle (Swedish B, WHO M89.51 shoulder + M89.52 upper arm). Target 1075750 (1332016001), the
        Athena Maps-to target for M89.52; broader (covers humerus, source also names clavicle/shoulder).
        Secondary 78308 (203522001), the general Maps-to for M89.51; looser. Primary high/broader
